# Mobs that breathe in a fight, run with @spec as mobile_update would, at the entrance to Mud School (3700), with
# only area_update running. Each mob starts a fight with Heroic (51, 30000 hit points), with a potion, a scroll, a
# drink and food on the floor; Smokegod (60) breaks it up, restores Heroic and purges the room between fights.
# - the gold dragon (breath_any, 42) many times, so each breath comes up
# - the fire bat (fire, 12), the water elemental (acid, 30), the white dragon (frost, 37), the lightning elemental
#   (lightning, 30)
# - the green dragon (gas, 41) fighting Heroic, with a drunk and a fido standing by: is_safe_spell spares them, as
#   a mob's area spell spares mobs not grouped with the one it's fighting
# - the green dragon fighting the drunk, with the fido by: the gas spares the drunk too (#81), so it hits no one
# - each of them, not fighting, does nothing
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3700
holylight
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer heroic 3700
set char heroic hp 30000
restore heroic
@obj 105 3700
@obj 1362 3700
@obj 3001 3700
@obj 3009 3700
@mob 631 3700
@spec
force dragon kill heroic
@spec 48
peace
restore heroic
purge
@pulse 12
